samples/xr-glimmer
==================

Third-party content under `src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/`:

- `env_dark.jpg` — night cityscape photograph from Unsplash. Used under
  the [Unsplash License](https://unsplash.com/license) (free for commercial
  and non-commercial use, no attribution required). Centre-cropped to 4:3
  and resized to 960x720 for the AI Glasses preview canvas.

- `env_busy.jpg` — Bangkok street market photograph by Bruno van der Kraan
  (https://unsplash.com/photos/a-busy-street-market-is-filled-with-people-Jtu6HGNKK7Q).
  Used under the Unsplash License. Centre-cropped to 4:3 and resized to 960x720.

- `env_venice_canal_cats.jpg` — Venice canal photograph featuring a gondolier
  in a striped sailor shirt. Used under the Unsplash License. Centre-cropped
  to 4:3 and resized to 960x720. (The "cats" half of the `VeniceCanalCats`
  env name is the design's whimsical delight extension from
  `docs/design/GLIMMER_PREVIEW.md`; no cats in the photo, just the real-
  world gondolier inspiration.)

The `Glimmer XR Menu * Light` env still uses an in-Compose procedural
backdrop (no photo asset) and is therefore not subject to any third-party
attribution.

Photos are sourced under the Unsplash License, which permits use without
attribution but does not transfer copyright; attribution is provided here
as a courtesy. Substitute these files with any 960x720 (or larger) JPEG /
PNG / WebP at the same path and the build picks them up with no code
changes.
